confirm_setup.description:
**IMPORTANT:** Copy the credentials below and scan (or paste) them into your Android bridge app.

📋 **Webhook ID:** `{webhook_id}`

🔗 **Full URL:** {webhook_url}

🔑 **HMAC Secret (base64):** `{hmac_secret}`

📷 **QR Payload (scan with bridge app):**
```
{qr_payload}
```

Device ID: {device_id}{https_warning}

⚠️ You can also find the webhook URL later in the sensor attributes (Developer Tools → States → any InfinAssistant sensor → Attributes → webhook_url).

